        "locator": "title and description",
        "excerpt": "PR: fix: scheduling flake due to nodepool readiness [closed]\nFixes #N/A\n\n**Description**\nThe NodePool readiness controller checks for updates to NodeClasses based on their APIVersion along with the kind and name. Since this NodePool did not set the group, if the nodeclass was not ready before the first NodePool readiness reconciliation it would not be rereconciled and the NodePool would remain unready.\n\n**How was this change tested?**\n`make e2etests`\n\n**Does this change impact docs?**\n- [ ] Yes, PR includes docs updates\n- [ ] Yes, issue opened: #\n- [x] No\n\nBy submitting this",
